  "project_title": "Molecular responses and metabolic reset of apple fruit under postharvest low oxygen stress",
  "project_description": "In the present work we report data on the application of an integrated approach on apples held under two levels of low oxygen concentrations throughout the initial 2 months of storage, when, in general, strict control of the effects of the extremely low oxygen concentration is required for a successful DCA performance. Overall design: Examination of 4 different condition. Three replicates per condition",
